Company Description
Formatt Building Products Spain SLU (Technogips España) is an established manufacturer specializing in high-quality construction materials. Backed by extensive expertise and innovative solutions, the company is dedicated to supporting modern construction projects across Spain. With a focus on durability and efficiency, Technogips España strives to provide products that meet the highest industry standards. Located in Calahorra, the company serves as a vital resource for building professionals seeking reliable materials and excellent service.
We are currently seeking an ERP Expert in Microsoft Dynamics 365 with proven experience in module configuration. The selected candidate will work in a modern industrial environment, leading the parametrization, optimization, and continuous improvement of key processes across the plant.

Responsibilities:
Full configuration of D365 modules;
System customization, troubleshooting, and maintenance;
Analysis, design, and optimization of business and industrial processes;
Coordination with internal teams and external partners;
Training and support for key users;
Creation and ongoing actualization of technical and functional documentation;
Participation in continuous improvement projects and integrations with other corporate systems.

Qualifications:
Degree in Computer Science, IT, Business or a related field;
Proven experience configuring one or more D365 modules;
Ability to design and optimize end-to-end processes;
Experience with data management, workflows, testing and data migrations;
Advanced English language skills;
Analytical mindset and problem solving orientation;
Ability to work independently and as part of a team.

What we offer:
Full-time permanent position;
Modern and growing industrial environment;
Long-term international project;
Continuous training and development opportunities;
Dynamic and collaborative team culture.
